Z||000000||Adrift||09-23-2001||03:56 AM||||I decided to fill in the drain holes in my floorboards. I began by fiberglassing them shut, and then after the fiberglass cured and hardened I bolted a piece of anti-rust coated sheet melted on top of the fiberglass. I'll be taring the edges of the sheet metal tomorrow.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiberfloor.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/metalfloor.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
